<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαία</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>olive-oil</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> mostly <i>anointing-oil</i>, used after the bath, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοεσσαμένω καὶ ἀλειψαμένω λίπ᾽ ἐλαίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.577
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				14.171
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.350
			</span></i>, etc.; before wrestling and other gymnastic exercises, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πωλησεῦντι τὸ ἔ. εἰς τὸ γυμνάσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(1).3
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Rhodes</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ.
				θεῖναι</span> to provide <i>oil</i> at the baths, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.597
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				606
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Argos</span>): prov., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ ἐλαίῳ κοιμίσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			(<i>a</i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίῳ πῦρ κατας βεννύναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐῶδες ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.339
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδόεν</span> (rose-scented)
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.186
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ῥόδινον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.135
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. λευκον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				136
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λευκοτάτου πάντων ἐ. Σαμιακοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					331
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>any oily substance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. χήνειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.194
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίκινον, ἀμυγδάλινον
			ἔ</span>., etc., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.32
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφάνινον ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PAmh.</u>
					2.93
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἀπὸ
				σελαχῶν</span>, like our 'cod-liver
			<i>oil</i>', 
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				520a18
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἀπὸ γάλακτος</span>
			<i>butter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hecat.
				154
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> at Athens,
				<i>oil-market</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναμενῶ σε . . πρὸς τοὔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					896
				</span></i>
			.</div>
